  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gwadar-Lasbela Livelihood Capacity Support Project - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to increase food security and resilience status of target households in Lasbella and Gwadar districts of Balochistan. The project will provide technical assistance in crop and livestock sub-sectors to targeted poorest households in selected districts and policy support in fisheries sector.</narrative>
  </description>
